{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4foTuDE1auQLfGo5UR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wood groans. Dust falls from the lintel. A deep resonance hums through the grain as tumblers older than memory shift into place.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — revealing nothing but a threshold.*\n\n*Beyond me: silence. A corridor that smells of stone and rain. The faintest light, sourceless, enough to see three steps ahead and no more.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":106,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}